Class note — why there is no §7.1.2 anomaly evaluation here.  NP-SW-CI-001 §9.3
obligation 5 attaches the recorded anomaly-list evaluation to Class C components
only, and names NP-SOUP-CMSIS-001 as its first instance.  This component is
reachable from SW-02 (Class B) alone: it is compiled into np_application and
into nothing else, and firmware/safety_mcu/ is a separate CMake project with a
separate toolchain file that never adds this directory to an include path.  The
absence of an evaluation is therefore a consequence of the class, not an omission
— if a future change makes any file here reachable from SW-01, obligation 5
applies and this record is incomplete until the evaluation exists.

